Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:04.07,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.29,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of characters \NI never learned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:07.51,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,Nina, you read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:10.31,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Huh? I can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.68,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,Please, keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.39,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,I'll read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:15.41,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:20.53,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"Dear Eris, it's been so \Nlong since I last saw you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.62,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"This is Rudeus Greyrat."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:26.31,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"Do you still remember our \Nfirst night together?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:31.57,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"I swore then to remain true \Nto you as long as I lived."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:36.95,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"But when I woke in the morning, \Nyou were not beside me."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:43.05,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"The loss and despondency I felt then \Nspawned a deep darkness within me."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:48.03,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,I... I left a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:51.98,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"Yet I am writing to you"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:57.45,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"because I've been told that your \Nheart has always been set on me."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:01:01.19,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"I had felt certain that \Nyou had abandoned me."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:08.47,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"If your feelings have not changed, \NI am prepared to accept them."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:15.08,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"But as I have two wives at present, \Nyou would be my third."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:17.89,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"If you cannot bring \Nyourself to forgive me,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:20.73,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"I am prepared to accept your fist."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:27.39,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"Even if we cannot become family, \NI hope to renew our friendship."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.36,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"Yours in haste."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:31.76,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,Despicable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.90,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,What does he take women for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:36.61,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,It seemed pretty considerate to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:39.70,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,Considerate?! \NHe didn't even say he loved her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:42.82,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Eris has to take some of the \Nblame for ditching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:45.34,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's only interested \Nin Eris for her body!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:48.00,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,If that's it, he's got a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.83,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,Eris, you should forget about \NSharia and come to Asura with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:55.59,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Hey, there's another page.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:56.62,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:01:58.73,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:02:00.05,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"P.S."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:05.43,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"I am about to challenge \NDragon God Orsted to battle."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:09.23,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"I don't know if I can beat him."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:14.10,Main,Isolde,0,0,0,,"I hope to continue our correspondence \Nif I make it home alive."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:22.23,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry or we'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:25.12,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ghislaine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:28.59,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.09,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,I'm on my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:35.67,Main,Eris,0,0,0,,Rudeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.38,Ep_Title,Sign; title,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad2}Episode 14\NResolve

